parse_delivery_window accepts a delivery window in the exact form "HH:MM-HH:MM". Hours must be 00 through 23, minutes must be 00 through 59, and the end must be later than the start. Return a pair containing the start and end time as minutes after midnight. Raise ValueError for any other input, including non-strings and windows containing surrounding whitespace.

